#. Description of the plugin
#: onetrace-woocommerce.php
msgid "Connects the store to OneTrace.pro, the customer data platform: orders, customers and consents from the server, the website tracker, the product catalog with stock, wishlists, recommendation widgets, Web Push and the store's emails through OneTrace."
msgstr ""

